</head>

<body lang=EN-US style='tab-interval:.5in'>

<div class=WordSection1>

<h1 align=center style='text-align:center'><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";color:#0078D4'>Microsoft Practice
Management Hub<o:p></o:p></span></h1>

<h3 align=center style='text-align:center'><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";color:#555555'>Project Overview &amp;
Status Document<o:p></o:p></span></h3>

<div class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span
style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>

<hr size=3 width="100%" align=center>

</span></div>

<h2><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>1.
Introduction (Overview)<o:p></o:p></span></h2>

<p><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif'>The <b>Microsoft Practice
Management Hub</b> is a centralized, modern web portal designed to help
practice leadership seamlessly manage resources, track project delivery, and
monitor the overall health and skills of the practice.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<h2><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>2.
Current Capabilities (What We Have Right Now)<o:p></o:p></span></h2>

<ul type=disc>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;
     mso-list:l3 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in'><b><span style='font-family:
     "Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Resource
     Management:</span></b><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;
     mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'> View and track all practice
     consultants, their designations, experience levels, current availability
     (bench vs. allocated), and skills.<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;
     mso-list:l3 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in'><b><span style='font-family:
     "Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Project
     &amp; Allocation Tracking:</span></b><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;
     mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'> Monitor active enterprise
     projects, their required staffing levels, project health, and currently
     allocated team members.<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;
     mso-list:l3 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in'><b><span style='font-family:
     "Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Dynamic
     Dashboard &amp; Navigation:</span></b><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;
     mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'> A central dashboard providing
     high-level metrics. The sidebar navigation now dynamically updates in real-time
     to reflect the exact number of active resources and projects currently in
     the database.<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;
     mso-list:l3 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in'><b><span style='font-family:
     "Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Cloud
     Infrastructure:</span></b><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;
     mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'> The system is fully integrated
     with <b>Microsoft Azure Storage</b> (Table Storage and Blob Storage) for
     secure, scalable, and reliable data management in the cloud.<o:p></o:p></span></li>
</ul>

<h2><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>3.
How to Run the Project (Getting Started)<o:p></o:p></span></h2>

<ol start=1 type=1>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;
     mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in'><b><span style='font-family:
     "Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Prerequisites:</span></b><span
     style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>
     Ensure you have the <b>.NET 8.0 SDK</b> installed on your machine. You
     will also need an IDE such as Visual Studio 2022 or Visual Studio Code.<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;
     mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in'><b><span style='font-family:
     "Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Configure
     Database (Azure Storage):</span></b><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;
     mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'> <o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <ul type=circle>
  <li class=MsoNormal style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
      auto;mso-list:l2 level2 lfo3;tab-stops:list 1.0in'><span
      style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Open
      the </span><span class=SpellE><code><span style='font-size:10.0pt'>appsettings.json</span></code></span><span
      style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>
      file located in the </span><span class=SpellE><code><span
      style='font-size:10.0pt'>MicrosoftPracticeManagement.Web</span></code></span><span
      style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>
      folder.<o:p></o:p></span></li>
  <li class=MsoNormal style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
      auto;mso-list:l2 level2 lfo3;tab-stops:list 1.0in'><span
      style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Ensure
      the </span><span class=SpellE><code><span style='font-size:10.0pt'>TableStorageConnection</span></code></span><span
      style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>
      and </span><span class=SpellE><code><span style='font-size:10.0pt'>BlobStorageConnection</span></code></span><span
      style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>
      strings contain a valid Azure Storage connection string. (If you prefer
      local development, you can use the Microsoft Azurite emulator).<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 </ul>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;
     mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in'><b><span style='font-family:
     "Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Build the
     Solution:</span></b><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;
     mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'> <o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <ul type=circle>
  <li class=MsoNormal style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
      auto;mso-list:l2 level2 lfo3;tab-stops:list 1.0in'><span
      style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Open
      your terminal or command prompt at the project root directory.<o:p></o:p></span></li>
  <li class=MsoNormal style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
      auto;mso-list:l2 level2 lfo3;tab-stops:list 1.0in'><span
      style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Run
      the command: </span><span class=SpellE><code><span style='font-size:10.0pt'>dotnet</span></code></span><code><span
      style='font-size:10.0pt'> build</span></code><span style='font-family:
      "Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'><o:p></o:p></span></li>
 </ul>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;
     mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in'><b><span style='font-family:
     "Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Run the
     Application:</span></b><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;
     mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'> <o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <ul type=circle>
  <li class=MsoNormal style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
      auto;mso-list:l2 level2 lfo3;tab-stops:list 1.0in'><span
      style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Navigate
      into the Web project folder: </span><code><span style='font-size:10.0pt'>cd
      <span class=SpellE>MicrosoftPracticeManagement.Web</span></span></code><span
      style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'><o:p></o:p></span></li>
  <li class=MsoNormal style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
      auto;mso-list:l2 level2 lfo3;tab-stops:list 1.0in'><span
      style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Run
      the command: </span><span class=SpellE><code><span style='font-size:10.0pt'>dotnet</span></code></span><code><span
      style='font-size:10.0pt'> run</span></code><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;
      mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'><o:p></o:p></span></li>
 </ul>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;
     mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in'><b><span style='font-family:
     "Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Access the
     Portal:</span></b><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;
     mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'> Open your web browser and
     navigate to the </span><code><span style='font-size:10.0pt'>localhost</span></code><span
     style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>
     URL provided in your terminal output (typically </span><code><span
     style='font-size:10.0pt'>https://localhost:7193</span></code><span
     style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>
     or similar).<o:p></o:p></span></li>
</ol>

<h2><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>4.
Next Steps<o:p></o:p></span></h2>

<ol start=1 type=1>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;
     mso-list:l0 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-family:
     "Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'><span
     style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;</span>Planning to implement the logic to allocate
     the project to resources.<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;
     mso-list:l0 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-family:
     "Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Will move
     to new module implementation as a next step.<o:p></o:p></span></li>
</ol>

<p class=MsoNormal style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto'><span
style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

</div>

</body>

</html>
